# ICICI Direct Breeze API — vendor knowledge base

**Authoritative vendor docs:** [Breeze API Reference](https://api.icicidirect.com/breezeapi/documents/index.html)

When implementing or debugging ICICI Direct / Breeze (auth, orders, quotes, WS, margins), **use that documentation as the source of truth** for endpoints, params, headers, checksum, and sample payloads. Do not invent request shapes. Project mapping lives in `Docs/architecture.md` §8.9 / §11.8–11.15.

## Out of scope

- **Do not implement GTT** (`gttorder`, GTT order book, place/cancel/modify GTT). This project does not use Good Till Triggered orders.

